📝 USER STORY:
As a Chauffeur
I want to view the stream of recent community messages in my area with cursor pagination
So that I stay informed on real-time discussions from local peers without skipping messages

📋 BUSINESS RULES & QUERY SPECIFICATIONS:
• Endpoint: GET /api/v1/community-chats/messages
• Authentication: Bearer JWT Token required
• Scoping: Returns only messages matching user.serviceArea
• Population: sender { name, profilePicture }
• Pagination: Cursor-based infinite scroll (nextCursor, hasMore, limit)
• Response: { success: true, message: 'Community messages retrieved successfully', cursor: { nextCursor, hasMore, limit }, data: ICommunityMessage[], serviceArea }

