📝 USER STORY:
As a Chauffeur
I want to delete a completed or stale chat conversation
So that my inbox remains tidy and relevant

📋 BUSINESS RULES:
• Endpoint: DELETE /api/v1/chats/:chatId
• Authentication: Bearer JWT Token required (must be chat participant)
• Cascade Behavior: Automatically deletes all associated Message documents in DB
• Response: { success: true, message: 'Chat deleted successfully', data: { message: 'Chat deleted successfully' } }

